  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening the capacity of coastal communities to protect their cultural and natural heritage and to promote foster sustainable tourism</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall purpose of this project is to strengthen the local capacities of the communities from Cardenas Municipality, in the state of Tabasco, for them to be able to safeguard and manage their cultural and natural heritage to promote sustainable development in the region, increase their resilience to climate change impacts, and support inclusive economic development. In this sense, the project responds to UNESCO 41 C/5 Output 5.CLT 4 &#x201C;&#xB4;Member States&#x2019; and communities&#x2019; capacities strengthened to identify, safeguard and promote living heritage&#x201D;.</narrative>
  </description>
